# CPython retains interpreter allocations at exit. Only its allocator frames
# are suppressed; malloc/calloc in redsocks, cntlm, libevent and OpenSSL remain
# checked, including when those functions are called through ctypes.
leak:_PyObject_Malloc
leak:PyObject_Malloc
leak:PyMem_Malloc
leak:_PyMem_RawMalloc
leak:PyMem_RawMalloc
